*E_NAME		"Navisko Guard"

*E_CHAT		"There is rumour about a bunch of    monsters wandering in the village,  but I've never seen any of them.    How strange..!"
*E_CHAT		"I think I saw a bunch of Bargons    last night. I forgot what happened  after. Something must be wrong here."  
*E_CHAT		"Many people come in and out to visitthe SOD amphitheater. It's not easy to guard the city all by myself."
